Canonical project rules are split across [[.cursor/rules/]]:

- [[.cursor/rules/core-agent-behavior.mdc]] — interaction, planning mindset, surgical changes
- [[.cursor/rules/project-values.mdc]] — project aims and stack
- [[.cursor/rules/environment.mdc]] — shell, paths, tooling
- [[.cursor/rules/fsharp-source.mdc]] — F# conventions (scoped to *.fs)
- [[.cursor/rules/markdown-writing.mdc]] — markdown conventions (scoped to *.md)
- [[.cursor/rules/testing-workflow.mdc]] — TDD, test running, and Client compile gate (scoped to tests, Shared, Client)
- [[.cursor/rules/planning-docs.mdc]] — roadmap/plan documents (scoped to doc/)
- [[.cursor/rules/work-blackboard.mdc]] — shared task board protocol
- [[.cursor/rules/project-stage.mdc]] — keep each `.scratch/` project's `Stage:` and the overview current

Shared runtime state:

- [[WORK.md]] — live actionable work (Active, Pending, Blocked)
- [[CONTEXT.md]] — concise domain glossary

Imported engineering skill configuration:

- [[docs/agents/issue-tracker.md]] — local Markdown issue tracker, shared language, and Wayfinder operations
- [[docs/agents/triage-labels.md]] — default triage role vocabulary
- [[docs/agents/domain.md]] — canonical project docs under [[doc/]] and Committed Decisions under [[docs/Decisions/]]
- [[docs/agents/project-status.md]] — per-project `Stage:` vocabulary and the `.scratch/index.md` overview

